# 0.5: the "needs an operator" advice lists only the operators
# the genre accepts. Under sequence `--` is a line error, so the advice names
# -> <- <-> and not the four the other connector spellings take.
figdown 0.5 sequence
lifeline c "Client"
lifeline s "Server"
message c s "request"
message c - s
message c -> s "the clean line still parses"
